# The actual unreleased/internal Aerospike server RPM (see local/README.md)
# and the override that activates it. Never commit either — the RPM is
# unreleased software; the override is auto-generated by scripts/start
# whenever local/server.rpm is present, so it never needs to be hand-edited
# or tracked. Everything else under local/ (the Dockerfile, the README) is
# plain generic tooling with nothing confidential in it, so it's tracked
# normally.
/local/*.rpm
/docker-compose.override.yml
